{"parentUuid":"7d671609-2dae-49a9-b8eb-76b0f373c8dd","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a8dd9313c22d94da5","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CezeTuhBzFtFDpZ3R9CLe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014Ph2dXTyD7LthjN8GSWmBY","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\tensh\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-tensh-eigo-radio\\294958fe-da6e-491c-8a02-4f864d8195c8\\scratchpad\\stage3_numbers_check.txt"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":930,"cache_read_input_tokens":262175,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":930,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_014Ph2dXTyD7LthjN8GSWmBY":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\tensh\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-tensh-eigo-radio\\294958fe-da6e-491c-8a02-4f864d8195c8\\scratchpad\\stage3_numbers_check.txt"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CezeTuAwHjqnbHqwzBEns","attributionAgent":"sonnet-worker","type":"assistant","uuid":"a6af5f36-6bd2-4bf1-8dd9-674b7ed0a87c","timestamp":"2026-09-13T02:26:10.220Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\tensh\\eigo-radio","sessionId":"294958fe-da6e-491c-8a02-4f864d8195c8","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"main","slug":"valiant-booping-rose"}
{"parentUuid":"a6af5f36-6bd2-4bf1-8dd9-674b7ed0a87c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6e141bb0-49ee-4a90-a678-32a364632c50","agentId":"a8dd9313c22d94da5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014Ph2dXTyD7LthjN8GSWmBY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tvoice_1 digits_found= []\n2\tI send in my CV and speak to a camera, knowing software may score my tone, face, and gestures. I want my skills and character seen, not reduced to a score I cannot question. I could do well on a skills test, yet a low mark on my expression could end the process. I cannot ignore a woman�fs account of that experience or a long period without work. I also cannot ignore an applicant given no chance to opt out or appeal after a �gtrustworthiness�h score.\n3\t---\n4\tvoice_2 digits_found= []\n5\tAfter using screening software on a large stack of CVs, I still answer people who ask how they were judged. I need the tool to match skills to jobs, but I also need to explain its role. I may have to prepare a bias-audit summary or transparency notice. I saw a public notice showing that an independent review of an employment tool had been carried out. I did not choose the system, but I must operate it carefully. I also have to judge what an AI-written CV means.\n6\t---\n7\tvoice_3 digits_found= []\n8\tEach week I check the dashboard for hiring time and cost. I ask whether we can fill jobs fast enough. AI is tempting because some reports show hiring moving from weeks to days, while others report lower costs. I feel relief when my team fills roles on time. But I also think about the legal and ethical risk if an AI decision harms people. If that becomes public, my name is attached to the choice. I am protecting the company and trust in my judgment.\n9\t---\n10\t"}]},"uuid":"58529192-5f8a-43ad-a576-05e5a13a3a9c","timestamp":"2026-09-13T02:26:10.236Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\tensh\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-tensh-eigo-radio\\294958fe-da6e-491c-8a02-4f864d8195c8\\scratchpad\\stage3_numbers_check.txt","content":"voice_1 digits_found= []\nI send in my CV and speak to a camera, knowing software may score my tone, face, and gestures. I want my skills and character seen, not reduced to a score I cannot question. I could do well on a skills test, yet a low mark on my expression could end the process. I cannot ignore a woman�fs account of that experience or a long period without work. I also cannot ignore an applicant given no chance to opt out or appeal after a �gtrustworthiness�h score.\n---\nvoice_2 digits_found= []\nAfter using screening software on a large stack of CVs, I still answer people who ask how they were judged. I need the tool to match skills to jobs, but I also need to explain its role. I may have to prepare a bias-audit summary or transparency notice. I saw a public notice showing that an independent review of an employment tool had been carried out. I did not choose the system, but I must operate it carefully. I also have to judge what an AI-written CV means.\n---\nvoice_3 digits_found= []\nEach week I check the dashboard for hiring time and cost. I ask whether we can fill jobs fast enough. AI is tempting because some reports show hiring moving from weeks to days, while others report lower costs. I feel relief when my team fills roles on time. But I also think about the legal and ethical risk if an AI decision harms people. If that becomes public, my name is attached to the choice. I am protecting the company and trust in my judgment.\n---\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a6af5f36-6bd2-4bf1-8dd9-674b7ed0a87c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\tensh\\eigo-radio","sessionId":"294958fe-da6e-491c-8a02-4f864d8195c8","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"main","slug":"valiant-booping-rose"}
